  "body_html": "<p>Support your favorite sport with this vibrant Softball-Themed Comforter Set from Jeminise, perfect for softball players and fans alike. Designed to bring a relaxing and spirited feel to any bedroom, this set offers both comfort and a unique style.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Show your dedication to softball with a spirited design that celebrates the courage of supporting your team.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit your bed perfectly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fade-Resistant:</strong> Features environmental protection finishing techniques to ensure the fabric holds onto its vibrant dyes and prevents fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Breathable Comfort:</strong> Microfiber material is cool and breathable, offering greater durability than cotton for long-lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly, making maintenance simple and convenient.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes a soft and comfortable comforter.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin 68\"x90\"(173cm*218cm), Full 79\"x90\"(200cm*230cm), Queen 90x90\"(228cm*228cm), King 104\"x90\"(228cm*264cm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash; Tumble dry low. Note: It's better wash microfiber quilts blankets in a mesh laundry bag.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
